{
  "id": "secureMomDeliver",
  "name": "Secure MOM: deliver minutes",
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "saveDataSuccessExecution": "none",
    "saveDataErrorExecution": "all",
    "saveManualExecutions": false
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "e4fbcfe2-55b6-462b-bcb0-6d2308e853a2",
      "name": "About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-40, -300],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 620,
        "height": 260,
        "content": "## Secure MOM delivery\nThe backend posts minutes the moderator approved (automation/README.md).\n1. **Receive minutes** checks `X-Secure-MOM-Token` with its Header Auth credential \"Secure MOM token\" (setup.sh sets it to `SECURE_MOM_N8N_TOKEN`): 403 before the workflow runs.\n2. **Payload complete?** `from`, `to` (a non-empty list), `subject`, `html` and `text` are required, `cc` is a list; else 400.\n3. **Meeting type** adds the subject prefix and footer of medical, executive or administrative meetings; any other type is a 400.\n4. **Send email** goes through MailHog, the local SMTP server (`mailhog:1025`): 200 `{\"sent\": true}`, or 502 if it fails."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "3338855f-a40b-4241-bc37-870d913d929d",
      "name": "Receive minutes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [0, 200],
      "webhookId": "c46dd12b-d8fd-4715-99b2-ec838b16ec32",
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "secureMomToken01",
          "name": "Secure MOM token"
        }
      },
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "secure-mom",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "48070265-8ee9-4b19-8d5e-6d06584e53ce",
      "name": "Payload complete?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [440, 100],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 3
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cee0004a-430e-4802-a5a5-b3503d321b66",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.from?.trim() }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "b7fcf089-cf88-470a-86cf-ed38da5a2b5e",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.to }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "array",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "2f0000eb-94d6-48f3-9b81-197064d11460",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.cc ?? [] }}",
              "rightValue": 0,
              "operator": {
                "type": "array",
                "operation": "lengthGte",
                "rightType": "number"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "59eb0687-8d6a-4f39-be6d-890da25134cd",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.subject?.trim() }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "62a84eab-847c-463f-93bb-e077373e5349",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.html?.trim() }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "9b34f14d-ee43-4dfa-bfa7-aec72572f632",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.text?.trim() }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "50b74364-32f8-4906-a021-f0cbe945a441",
      "name": "400 invalid payload",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [660, 300],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "{\n  \"detail\": \"the payload needs from, to (a non-empty list), cc (a list, optional), subject, html and text\"\n}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 400
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "02d80f79-a9dd-4c8b-ac1b-04c796e65b62",
      "name": "Meeting type",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [660, 0],
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "loose",
                  "version": 3
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "39a13b36-1030-4471-9a1f-4c3aff346347",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.meeting_type }}",
                    "rightValue": "medical",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "medical"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "loose",
                  "version": 3
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "67104adb-5799-41ab-9951-b04a90539322",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.meeting_type }}",
                    "rightValue": "executive",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "executive"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "loose",
                  "version": 3
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "f593fd2c-9c37-4364-aebd-f2294101f27b",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.meeting_type }}",
                    "rightValue": "administrative",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "administrative"
            }
          ]
        },
        "looseTypeValidation": true,
        "options": {
          "fallbackOutput": "extra",
          "renameFallbackOutput": "other"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cfdd7077-f401-4aa5-87af-d3ed81c6b2dd",
      "name": "Medical board",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [900, -200],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "f679e336-d898-4435-853a-67f1828744ac",
              "name": "subject_prefix",
              "value": "[Medical]",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a48f0ba2-f620-410e-b33c-05555b78a85b",
              "name": "footer",
              "value": "Medical board minutes, approved by the moderator and sent by Secure MOM. Confidential: they contain patient information, do not forward them outside Medpark.",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "aeb892d4-e2ba-4444-a6ad-63de00d70a7f",
      "name": "Executive meeting",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
